      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents frequently note how comfortably their animals are treated, especially timid puppies, anxious shepherds, and large energetic breeds. Reviewers appreciate that the technicians take time to help pets relax before examinations and routine treatments like ear packings. Owners feel reassured leaving nervous dogs in their care."
      }
